sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant B as Browser
    participant LB as Load Balancer
    participant API as Redirect Service
    participant C as Cache
    participant DB as URL DB

    B->>LB: GET /abc12X
    LB->>API: forward
    API->>C: get abc12X
    alt cache hit
        C-->>API: long_url
        API-->>B: 302 Found → long_url
    else cache miss
        C-->>API: miss
        API->>DB: lookup abc12X
        DB-->>API: long_url
        API->>C: populate cache
        API-->>B: 302 Found → long_url
    end
